<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Aggregation - 标签 - Luhong's Blog</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/tags/aggregation/</link><description>Aggregation - 标签 - Luhong's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.luhg.cn/tags/aggregation/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>聚合查询与索引设计</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/08-%E8%81%9A%E5%90%88%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Luhong</author><guid>https://blog.luhg.cn/08-%E8%81%9A%E5%90%88%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E4%B8%8E%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h1 id="聚合查询与索引设计">聚合查询与索引设计</h1>
<p>目标：按品牌统计商品数量，并掌握几个避免后期返工的 Mapping 原则。</p>
<h2 id="1-什么是聚合">1. 什么是聚合</h2>
<p>聚合不是返回每一条商品，而是返回统计结果。例如“每个品牌有多少商品”：</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-json">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="err">GET</span> <span class="err">/products/_search</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="nt">&#34;size&#34;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">,</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="nt">&#34;aggs&#34;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&#34;brand_count&#34;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">      <span class="nt">&#34;terms&#34;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&#34;field&#34;</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="s2">&#34;brand&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">      <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p><code>size: 0</code> 表示不需要普通搜索结果，只需要统计。</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>